OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for causing wrong-way
OL,4,Apolice chase crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who crashed into an oncoming car
OL,7,Fafter driving the wrong way along the
OL,8,FA46 during a police chase, seriously
OL,9,Finjuring another driver, has been
OL,10,Fjailed.
OL,12,FNiks Rogacs, 26, was driving a white
OL,13,FMercedes van which had been reported
OL,14,Fstolen when the crash took place
OL,15,Fshortly after 04:30 BST on 29 June.
OL,17,FWhile high on cocaine, he fled after
OL,18,Fbeing spotted by Leicestershire Police,
OL,19,Fbut drove on to the wrong side of the
OL,20,FA46 before hitting a blue BMW 1 Series
OL,21,Fnear Glenfield.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
